{"html": "<section class=\"ec-product-scenarios ec-library-detail-section\" id=\"product-use-scenarios\" data-scene-ver=\"7\" aria-labelledby=\"product-scenario-title\"><p class=\"ec-scenario-kicker\">用途与选型</p><h2 id=\"product-scenario-title\">适用场景建议</h2><p class=\"ec-scenario-role\">568 mlTritan 品脱 / 扎啤杯型</p><div class=\"ec-scenario-grid\"><article class=\"ec-scenario-card\"><h3><a href=\"/zh/backyard-bbq-cups/\">后院烧烤 <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></h3><p>568 ml Tritan直身杯型，宽底厚壁。客人自己从冰桶里拿，杯口大、倒得快，不用排队等。</p></article><article class=\"ec-scenario-card\"><h3><a href=\"/zh/open-air-nightclub/\">户外酒吧 <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></h3><p>一晚补三次货的台子，杯身能叠、洗得快，出杯速度跟得上。</p></article><article class=\"ec-scenario-card\"><h3><a href=\"/zh/tailgate-party-cups/\">尾箱与汽车派对 <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></h3><p>开球前在车尾递一圈，宽底放得住折叠桌，风大也不倒。</p></article></div><div class=\"ec-scenario-check\"><h3>项目确认</h3><p>核对长桌摆位、多人轮次与清洗条件；出杯速度、叠放收纳与夜间照明条件；场地容器规定、单杯份量与车载携带方式。</p></div><p class=\"ec-scenario-note\">以上为选型建议。请按实际用途审核所选配置与样品。</p><a class=\"ec-scenario-cta\" href=\"/zh/contact/?models=PJB-040\">讨论 PJB-040 的应用方案 →</a></section>", "kind": "product"}